---
source: crates/runtime/tests/metadata/mod.rs
expression: explain_met_size_filtered
---
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: met_size.id ASC NULLS LAST, met_size._size ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |   Filter: met_size._size = UInt64(2319)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |     TableScan: met_size projection=[id, value, year, month, day, _size], partial_filters=[met_size._size = UInt64(2319)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
| physical_plan | SortPreservingMergeExec: [id@0 ASC NULLS LAST, _size@5 ASC NULLS LAST]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |   SortExec: expr=[id@0 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |       DataSourceExec: file_groups={3 groups: [[hive_partitioned_data/year=2022/month=1/day=1/data_0.parquet, hive_partitioned_data/year=2022/month=1/day=2/data_4.parquet], [hive_partitioned_data/year=2023/month=2/day=2/data_1.parquet, hive_partitioned_data/year=2022/month=3/day=3/data_2.parquet], [hive_partitioned_data/year=2023/month=4/day=1/data_3.parquet]]}, projection=[id, value, year, month, day, _size], file_type=parquet, predicate=_size@5 = 2319, sort_order_for_reorder=[id@0 ASC NULLS LAST], pruning_predicate=_size_null_count@2 != row_count@3 AND _size_min@0 <= 2319 AND 2319 <= _size_max@1, required_guarantees=[_size in (2319)] |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
